# Live explorers (multiplayer in the walk world) are off unless site/site.json says
# "live": { "enabled": true, ... } AND these name a Supabase project (docs/live-explorers.md).
# Any ONE of these key names works (vite.config.ts whitelists them):
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY,
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,
#   SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   (as set by the Vercel <> Supabase integration)
# Never put a secret / service_role key under any of these names: the build refuses it, and
# `npm run build` scans dist/ for one afterwards (scripts/check-bundle.mjs).
# Production deploys (VERCEL_ENV=production, or LIVE_ENV=production on other hosts) join
# "<channel>-v1"; every other build joins "<channel>-preview".
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
